flowchart LR

IN["`◀ from 1, 2, 3 and 4`"]

PGB["`PgBouncer :6432`"]
PGB_N["`transaction pooling · prepared statements OFF
concentrates: thousands of clients to 100-200 real
max_connections=100 is the first wall to hit
makes nothing faster today: it is preventive`"]
PGB -.- PGB_N

PG["`PostgreSQL 17 + pgvector`"]
PG_N["`users · providers · user_providers · refresh_tokens
auth_logs · audit_logs · verification_tokens
subjects · plans · modules · academic_items
academic_item_category(+_types) · icons · colors
academic_item_source, the passages behind an item
document · document_content · document_format
plan_generation · plan_document · ai_provider
plan_generation_model_usage, tokens + USD/model
chunks: vector(1024) HNSW cosine + TSVECTOR index
no separate vector DB: chunks commit with the row
SQLAlchemy 2.0 async · Alembic migrations only`"]
PG -.- PG_N

RDS["`Redis 8`"]
RDS_N["`db0 cache · db1 broker · db2 results
db3 rate limit · login lockout · OAuth state
embedding cache (7d) · circuit-breaker keys
dead letter list
separate logical dbs so flushing a cache
never drops a queue`"]
RDS -.- RDS_N

MIO["`MinIO · S3 compatible`"]
MIO_N["`bucket profplan · {subject_id}/{uuid}.ext
filename is user input, never a path
no per-request cost, no egress cost
moving to real S3 = endpoint + credential`"]
MIO -.- MIO_N

OLL["`Ollama`"]
OLL_N["`bge-m3 embeddings, 1024-d, multilingual
24x slower than the fastest option, kept
because the material is in Portuguese
changing it needs a migration, not a setting
llama3.2:3b chat fallback`"]
OLL -.- OLL_N

MAIL["`Mailpit :8025`"]
MAIL_N["`catches dev mail, no third-party account`"]
MAIL -.- MAIL_N

ADM["`Adminer :8081`"]
ADM_N["`DB UI, dev profile only
a DB UI on a production network is a liability`"]
ADM -.- ADM_N

NET["`Two Docker networks`"]
NET_N["`frontend: Traefik to API
backend: everything internal
Postgres, Redis and Ollama are NOT
published to the host`"]
NET -.- NET_N

IN ==> PGB
PGB ==>|"pooled sessions"| PG
IN ==> RDS
IN ==> MIO
IN ==> OLL
MAIL -.- NET
ADM -.-> PG

